.tmp-*

# Pyodide runtime — ~20 MB of wasm, stdlib and wheels, rebuilt before every dev
# and build by scripts/setup-pyodide.mjs. The runtime is copied out of
# node_modules (pinned by the lockfile); the wheels are NOT in the npm package,
# so the script downloads them from Pyodide's CDN at that exact version and
# checks each against the sha256 in pyodide-lock.json. Either way it is fully
# reproducible from the lockfile, so there is nothing to gain by committing it
# and 20 MB to lose.
/public/pyodide/
